  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - POWER PLANT MODERNIZATION REVERSE TRADE MISSION, through Global Marketing &amp; Communications, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $251,058 Ukraine Power Plant Modernization Reverse Trade Mission helps thermal power plant operators in Ukraine to become acquainted with the latest U.S. technology as they modernize their thermal power plants. Modernization of the power plants includes efficiency improvements and reductions in air pollution.</narrative>
